<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lab Environment Ready!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2563eb;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .success-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #34d399 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .lab-name {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .ready-indicator {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .access-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 36px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 25px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .access-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
        }
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .info-card {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
        }
        .info-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #1f2937;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .info-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border: 1px solid #f59e0b;
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .info-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🚀 {{companyName}}</div>
            <h1 class="title">🎉 Your Lab is Ready!</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

            <p>Excellent news! Your lab environment has been successfully set up and is ready for your hands-on learning experience.</p>

            <div class="success-banner">
                <div class="lab-name">{{labName}}</div>
                {{#if labDescription}}
                <p style="margin: 10px 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 16px;">{{labDescription}}</p>
                {{/if}}
                <div class="ready-indicator">✅ Environment Ready</div>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{accessUrl}}" class="access-button">🚀 Launch Lab Environment</a>
            </div>

            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>⏱️ Lab Duration</h3>
                    <p>{{duration}}</p>
                </div>
                {{#if expiresAt}}
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>📅 Session Expires</h3>
                    <p>{{formatDate expiresAt}} at {{formatTime expiresAt}}</p>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            {{#if expiresAt}}
            <div class="warning-box">
                <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Your lab environment will automatically terminate on {{formatDate expiresAt}} to manage resources efficiently. Make sure to save your progress before then!
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <p><strong>🎯 Ready to get started? Here's what to expect:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>🖥️ Access to a dedicated AWS environment</li>
                <li>🛠️ Pre-configured tools and software</li>
                <li>📋 Step-by-step lab instructions</li>
                <li>🎯 Hands-on challenges and exercises</li>
                <li>📊 Progress tracking throughout the lab</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Click the "Launch Lab Environment" button above to access your lab and begin your learning journey!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Need help or experiencing issues? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
